{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791833520, "covers_from": "2026-10-12T19:32:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-12T19:33:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791833580, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-12T19:32:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 40262, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "環境", "content": "住在舊社區倒垃圾就是必須等垃圾車或追垃圾車，這種方式對獨居者，尤其老人很不友善，懇請市長想辦法改善。", "display_name": "大同代表 No.40,262", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T19:32:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 18480, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "自強隧道從大直往士林的坑洞超大，不知道什麼時候會補（有一個月了）", "display_name": "士林代表 No.18,480", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T19:32:26+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 48076, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "基隆河兩旁的樹早在花博時期就被砍得一塌糊塗，當時感受莫名其妙心痛不已，希望你當上市長後，把樹種回", "display_name": "松山代表 Kirinban", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T19:32:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15578, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "育兒", "content": "是不是在兒童食安上可以有更易查詢的介面。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.15,578", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T19:32:47+00:00", "duration_seconds": 13, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13018, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "把大樹、小樹種回來～樹爺爺們是有靈性的，在祂的蔭下，人類才能生活的更美好！", "display_name": "大安代表 No.13,018", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 18480, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.18,480", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 48076, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 Kirinban", "district": "s